dsr-go
======

dsr-go is an independent Go port of deepseek-recipe
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-recipe), Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek,
licensed under the MIT License.

The port reproduces the behaviour of the original Rust implementation. The
bundled tokenizer files under static/tokenizers/ come from that repository;
their notices are in static/tokenizers/README.md.

The Go implementation is distributed under the MIT License as well; see LICENSE.
